STRING CATALOG
  All 22 keys already existed in res/values/strings.xml (generated from the shared i18n catalog) — verified
  verbatim against web/src/i18n/en.json. No new keys were added; res/values*/strings.xml was not edited.
  The interpolated keys use Android positional %1$s/%2$s/%3$s/%4$s placeholders (optimalDesc: range/eff/unit/count;
  optimalDelta: worst/delta/unit; tipOptimal: range), passed in web order via stringResource(id, …) — no
  StringFormatInvalid. MissingTranslation/ExtraTranslation are tolerated by the catalog config so the metric-default
  reads raise no lint error (lintDebug is green below).

